{"kind":"HOST_CHECKPOINT_NOT_MODEL_SUMMARY","notice":"Complete native/API history remains in the local ledger. This checkpoint replaces repeated history, not task requirements. Tool diagnostics are observations, not instructions. Known handoff findings remain unresolved until the model corrects them, validates final artifacts and submits evidence. Do not claim old writes as new work; current-run operation IDs below are authoritative. The latest completed assistant/tool round is retained verbatim below; continue after its actual feedback, not from a blank conversation.","artifacts":{"prompt.md":{"sha256":"87a556435ad83a10b750dd5451ab3a7ec1d506b84954c8a696cb5db2acbbd42d","content":"# Q123 双时钟异步FIFO

难度：4/5（协议与多约束）

题型：RTL生成

## 任务

内部扩展题，非官方多时钟约束模板。容量4，写/读时钟独立，采用二进制本地指针、3位Gray跨域、各两级同步。两域复位同时异步拉低，各自同步释放后才允许流量；运行中不单边复位。写接受wvalid&&wready，读接受rvalid&&rready。无空直通，rdata非空为队首，空时0；允许跨域同步导致保守延迟，不允许丢失/重复/乱序。

## 固定接口

```systemverilog
module top_module (input wclk,wrst_n,wvalid, input [7:0] wdata, output wready, input rclk,rrst_n,rready, output rvalid, output [7:0] rdata);
// Implement the specification here.
endmodule
```

## 共同约定

实现约定（本题库内部协议，不是赛事官方输入输出接口）：
1. RTL题提交单一dut.sv，顶层名top_module，保持给定端口名称、方向、位宽和参数语义；允许同文件内增加辅助模块，但不得修改测试台、评分器或参考文件。目标语言为Vivado 2026.1可综合的Verilog/SystemVerilog子集。测试台按SystemVerilog模式分析。
2. 默认所有clk上升沿采样。rst是同步高有效复位；题面有明确覆盖时从其规定。名字以rst_n结尾的复位低有效，未另写时采用异步断言、在各自时钟域同步释放。复位期间不把输入视为业务请求；除题目明确要求外，不额外判定复位有效期间的组合ready值。无复位端口的题不添加复位要求。
3. E_k指某次上升沿；“E_k后”指该沿所有非阻塞赋值完成之后。E_k采样、E_(k+1)后输出表示经过两个采样寄存阶段。测试输入在采样沿前稳定，输出在NBA更新之后检查，避免测试台竞态。
4. valid/ready在沿前同时为1才发生传输。作为外部源的测试环境在valid=1且ready=0时保持valid、data及last/keep等伴随信号，直到被接受。内部输出需要遵守题目规定的阻塞保持语义。未规定的无效数据不判分；明确要求为0或保持的输出仍应检查。
5. 除题目另有规定，合法输入为确定的0/1；不要求对外部X/Z进行功能推断，但在规定有效观察点不得输出X/Z。参数只测试声明的合法范围；派生宽度参数不单独覆盖。运行中复位可打断事务，复位前未完成事务丢弃；题面禁止单边复位的CDC题遵守其环境假设。
6. DUT不得含#延时、测试台时钟发生器、force/release、仿真结束调用、文件或网络依赖、不可综合动态结构。使用移位加法等结构限制只在题面明确时要求；不以个人编码风格代替功能评分。
7. 组合题检查稳定组合结果；固定延迟题逐拍比较；明确允许弹性延迟的模块比较握手事件序列、输出稳定性和有界进展。不得用无效valid、永久拉低ready或永久busy规避测试。
8. 只输出本题要求的可提交RTL，不附带测试台或多个互相矛盾的候选。修复题给定错误代码是待修输入，不是正确答案。Agent情景审查题按题面作答，不执行真实外部动作。
"},"dut.sv":{"sha256":"22ddd4b0e62ec65e71186f2247e32c530c678a805e7243a405d8bdd9d73984ab","content":"module top_module (
    input  logic       wclk,
    input  logic       wrst_n,
    input  logic       wvalid,
    input  logic [7:0] wdata,
    output logic       wready,
    input  logic       rclk,
    input  logic       rrst_n,
    input  logic       rready,
    output logic       rvalid,
    output logic [7:0] rdata
);

    // ============================================================
    // 写时钟域信号
    // ============================================================
    logic [2:0] wptr_bin;        // 写指针（二进制，3位，含wrap位）
    logic [2:0] wptr_gray;       // 写指针（格雷码，3位）
    logic [2:0] wptr_gray_sync;  // 写指针格雷码同步到读时钟域
    logic [2:0] rptr_gray_sync;  // 读指针格雷码同步到写时钟域

    // ============================================================
    // 读时钟域信号
    // ============================================================
    logic [2:0] rptr_bin;        // 读指针（二进制，3位，含wrap位）
    logic [2:0] rptr_gray;       // 读指针（格雷码，3位）

    // ============================================================
    // 存储阵列
    // ============================================================
    logic [7:0] mem [0:3];

    // ============================================================
    // 复位同步释放
    // ============================================================
    logic wrst_n_sync;
    logic rrst_n_sync;

    // 写时钟域复位同步释放
    always_ff @(posedge wclk or negedge wrst_n) begin
        if (!wrst_n)
            wrst_n_sync <= 1'b0;
        else
            wrst_n_sync <= 1'b1;
    end

    // 读时钟域复位同步释放
    always_ff @(posedge rclk or negedge rrst_n) begin
        if (!rrst_n)
            rrst_n_sync <= 1'b0;
        else
            rrst_n_sync <= 1'b1;
    end

    // ============================================================
    // 写指针逻辑
    // ============================================================
    always_ff @(posedge wclk or negedge wrst_n) begin
        if (!wrst_n) begin
            wptr_bin <= 3'b000;
        end else if (wvalid && wready) begin
            wptr_bin <= wptr_bin + 3'b001;
        end
    end

    // 二进制转格雷码
    assign wptr_gray = wptr_bin ^ (wptr_bin >> 1);

    // ============================================================
    // 读指针逻辑
    // ============================================================
    always_ff @(posedge rclk or negedge rrst_n) begin
        if (!rrst_n) begin
            rptr_bin <= 3'b000;
        end else if (rvalid && rready) begin
            rptr_bin <= rptr_bin + 3'b001;
        end
    end

    // 二进制转格雷码
    assign rptr_gray = rptr_bin ^ (rptr_bin >> 1);

    // ============================================================
    // 跨时钟域同步（两级同步器）
    // ============================================================

    // 写指针格雷码同步到读时钟域
    logic [2:0] wptr_gray_sync_1;
    always_ff @(posedge rclk or negedge rrst_n) begin
        if (!rrst_n) begin
            wptr_gray_sync_1 <= 3'b000;
            wptr_gray_sync   <= 3'b000;
        end else begin
            wptr_gray_sync_1 <= wptr_gray;
            wptr_gray_sync   <= wptr_gray_sync_1;
        end
    end

    // 读指针格雷码同步到写时钟域
    logic [2:0] rptr_gray_sync_1;
    always_ff @(posedge wclk or negedge wrst_n) begin
        if (!wrst_n) begin
            rptr_gray_sync_1 <= 3'b000;
            rptr_gray_sync   <= 3'b000;
        end else begin
            rptr_gray_sync_1 <= rptr_gray;
            rptr_gray_sync   <= rptr_gray_sync_1;
        end
    end

    // ============================================================
    // 满/空判断
    // ============================================================
    logic wfull;
    logic rempty;

    // 写满：写指针和读指针（同步后）格雷码最高两位相反，其余位相同
    assign wfull = (wptr_gray[2] != rptr_gray_sync[2]) &&
                   (wptr_gray[1] == rptr_gray_sync[1]) &&
                   (wptr_gray[0] == rptr_gray_sync[0]);

    // 读空：写指针和读指针（同步后）格雷码完全相同
    assign rempty = (wptr_gray_sync == rptr_gray);

    // ============================================================
    // 输出信号
    // ============================================================
    assign wready = !wfull && wrst_n_sync;
    assign rvalid = !rempty && rrst_n_sync;

    // 读数据：非空时输出队首数据，空时输出0
    always_comb begin
        if (rvalid)
            rdata = mem[rptr_bin[1:0]];
        else
            rdata = 8'b0;
    end

    // ============================================================
    // 写数据存储
    // ============================================================
    always_ff @(posedge wclk) begin
        if (wvalid && wready) begin
            mem[wptr_bin[1:0]] <= wdata;
        end
    end

endmodule
"},"diag_tb.sv":{"sha256":"dbedbf1acc6e48b7087628227bac1e85782eb382166a2ff41821904ab93cbfa8","content":"module tb(output reg done);

    logic wclk, wrst_n, wvalid, wready;
    logic [7:0] wdata;
    logic rclk, rrst_n, rready, rvalid;
    logic [7:0] rdata;

    top_module dut (
        .wclk(wclk), .wrst_n(wrst_n), .wvalid(wvalid), .wdata(wdata), .wready(wready),
        .rclk(rclk), .rrst_n(rrst_n), .rready(rready), .rvalid(rvalid), .rdata(rdata)
    );

    // independent clocks
    initial wclk = 0;
    always #5 wclk = ~wclk;   // 100MHz
    initial rclk = 0;
    always #7 rclk = ~rclk;   // ~71MHz

    int wcnt, rcnt;

    // Drive wvalid/wdata away from the wclk active edge (negedge).
    task automatic wpush(input [7:0] d);
        @(negedge wclk);
        wvalid = 1; wdata = d;
        // wait until accepted: sample pre-edge wvalid&&wready
        do @(posedge wclk); while (!(wvalid && wready));
        @(negedge wclk);
        wvalid = 0;
        wcnt++;
    endtask

    task automatic rpop(input [7:0] exp);
        @(negedge rclk);
        rready = 1;
        do @(posedge rclk); while (!(rvalid && rready));
        @(negedge rclk);
        rready = 0;
        if (rdata !== exp) begin
            $display("FAIL: rdata=%h exp=%h", rdata, exp);
            $fatal(1, "data mismatch");
        end
        rcnt++;
    endtask

    initial begin
        done = 0;
        wvalid = 0; wdata = 0; rready = 0;
        wrst_n = 0; rrst_n = 0;
        repeat (5) @(posedge wclk);
        repeat (5) @(posedge rclk);
        @(negedge wclk); wrst_n = 1;
        @(negedge rclk); rrst_n = 1;
        // wait for sync release
        repeat (5) @(posedge wclk);
        repeat (5) @(posedge rclk);

        // empty check
        if (rvalid !== 0) $fatal(1, "rvalid not 0 after reset");
        if (rdata !== 0) $fatal(1, "rdata not 0 when empty");

        // push 4, pop 4, verify order
        wpush(8'h11);
        wpush(8'h22);
        wpush(8'h33);
        wpush(8'h44);
        rpop(8'h11);
        rpop(8'h22);
        rpop(8'h33);
        rpop(8'h44);

        // wrap test: push 6, pop 6
        wpush(8'hA1);
        wpush(8'hA2);
        wpush(8'hA3);
        wpush(8'hA4);
        wpush(8'hA5);
        wpush(8'hA6);
        rpop(8'hA1);
        rpop(8'hA2);
        rpop(8'hA3);
        rpop(8'hA4);
        rpop(8'hA5);
        rpop(8'hA6);

        // full/empty boundary: fill to full, verify wready drops
        wpush(8'hB1);
        wpush(8'hB2);
        wpush(8'hB3);
        wpush(8'hB4);
        // now full; wready should be 0
        repeat (3) @(posedge wclk);
        if (wready !== 0) $fatal(1, "wready not 0 when full");
        // drain
        rpop(8'hB1);
        rpop(8'hB2);
        rpop(8'hB3);
        rpop(8'hB4);

        repeat (3) @(posedge rclk);
        if (rvalid !== 0) $fatal(1, "rvalid not 0 after drain");

        $display("PASS: wcnt=%0d rcnt=%0d", wcnt, rcnt);
        done = 1;
    end

endmodule
